{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["A covenant of salt — it seems to me the expression means permanence. So too regarding David: לו ולבניו ברית מלח — each is interpreted according to its own context, but לא תשבית מלח ברית אלהיך speaks of actual salt. 'A covenant of salt' — a covenant of permanence, standing for all generations."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:29.133177940Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}